# Build context: the repository root (docker/docker-compose.e2e.yml). Only market-web's sources reach the image, never the host's
# node_modules or build output, which would overwrite what the build stage installs and builds.
*
!market-web/
market-web/node_modules/
market-web/build/
market-web/dist/
market-web/.react-router/
market-web/test-results/
market-web/playwright-report/
